      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L10-ACTIVITY-001",
      "SourceSection": "10.1: Reading Logs",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The expression \\(\\log_{10} 1,\\!000 = 3\\) can be read as: “The log, base 10, of 1,000 is 3.”",
